  {
   "id": "694c37ef6ab3a41370d83ffa",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Apartment interior design in Eurovea City, Bratislava, custom furniture, 56 m²"
    },
    {
     "type": "text",
     "parts": [
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "<strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN</strong> developed an interior design project for a 56 m² apartment in <strong>Eurovea City</strong>, Bratislava. The project was based on the developer’s finishes, with an emphasis on functional space planning, contemporary aesthetics, and comfortable city living."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The heart of the apartment is an open-plan kitchen and living area with a kitchen island, bringing together the cooking area, the dining area, and a lounge space. The plan also includes a bedroom with a work area, a laundry room, a bathroom, an entrance hall with storage systems, and a terrace."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The project was completed under the <a href=\"/en/custom-furniture-bratislava-design-production\">“Furniture” design package</a> and includes the development of the interior concept, photorealistic 3D visualizations, the necessary technical documentation, and the design and manufacture of custom cabinet furniture in Bratislava."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The custom furniture solutions were developed alongside the interior, making it possible to use the apartment’s floor area efficiently and integrate storage systems and other furniture elements into the overall architecture of the space. Upholstered furniture, lighting, and decor were also selected."
      },
      {
       "t": "p",
       "html": "The interior features a light, neutral color palette with natural materials, understated decor, and functional solutions. All elements were adapted to the client’s budget while maintaining a balance between aesthetics, practicality, and contemporary style. The project was accompanied by design supervision from <strong>DUMSKAYA DESIGN</strong>."
      }
     ]
    },
